{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_05_end","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":11,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_05_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-5","storyName":"只能成功，不能失败","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"月见夜的计划成功，大部分野兽被坑杀，但月见夜却因此落单。而等空爆赶到时，只看到“雷之主”和倒下的月见夜……","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_05_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_05","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":9,"next":11,"characters":["空爆","月见夜","武士","义经","武士B","宝巫迦","梓兰"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"text","text":"冷风穿过竹叶，发出呜咽般的声响，如同亡魂的低语。","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$leaveshake","volume":"1","id":10},{"type":"text","text":"一支三十人的精锐部队，正用特制的绞索和滚木，拖动着“异兽”熔火蜗那小山般的尸体，在林间艰难行进。","id":11},{"type":"text","text":"尸体上，黑色的“诅咒”气息如活物般缓缓蠕动，散发出硫磺混着腐肉般的甜腥气味。周围的竹子一染上这股气息，便迅速变黑。","id":12},{"type":"dialog","id":13},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#10$2","focus":"m","duration":"2","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这黑气看来真的能影响环境，真奇怪。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"“诅咒”究竟是什么，月见夜？","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"有许多人研究过“诅咒”，但是，没有人得出过肯定的结论。","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":21},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我们只知道，人一旦接近“诅咒”太久，或者吃下了被“诅咒”的野兽的肉，也会受到“诅咒”影响，然后离奇死去。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"而如果有地方被“诅咒”侵染太久，也会变得十分诡异，难以接近。","id":24,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"在泡影国东边，就有一片竹林，百年前，曾有一头“异兽”身上的“诅咒”在那里爆发，直到今天，那片竹林依然是禁地。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"……真亏你们能在这种地方生活到今天。","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"自然虽然对我们多有考验，但也对我们多有馈赠，这很公平。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈哈，我喜欢，比想着我要尊重动物，我要尊重植物，哎呀，狩猎真野蛮之类的想法要强。","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"你是指梓兰小姐？","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#14$2","focus":"m","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我可没这么说，是你说的。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0d/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-14$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"你呢，你喜欢狩猎吗，空爆小姐？","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#13$2","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我？我……不知道。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-13$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":41},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军！许多野兽把我们包围了！","id":42,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":43},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"和计划一样！","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"不要回头！不要恋战！保持速度，目标地点就在前方两里处！","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":47},{"type":"dialog","id":48},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$leaveshake","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2112_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":51},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2112_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":52},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":53},{"type":"charslot","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#2$2","focus":"m","id":55},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$frontline_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_frontline_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":56,"musicid":1},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"月见夜，你们先赶路，这里交给我吧。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/63/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-2$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"你确定？","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"虽然我不知道我喜不喜欢狩猎，但是，我肯定很喜欢这把新武器！","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"别妨碍我！","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……我知道了。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"尝尝这个！","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":68},{"type":"charslot","id":69},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_attack1","id":70},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":71},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":72},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_weapon01","id":73},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":74},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_daoguang_blue","x":"-1","y":"8.3","rox":"78","roy":"-50","roz":"-112","yScale":"1","layer":"1","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":76},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":78},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_recoil","volume":"1","id":79},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":80},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":83},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":84},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"1","id":85},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#8$1","posto":"-200,0","focus":"m","duration":"0.5","id":86},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"啧，这家伙好硬！","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"别跑——","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":91},{"type":"charslot","id":92},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice3","volume":"1","text":"","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_attack","volume":"1","text":"","id":94},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_arrow","volume":"1","id":95},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":96},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":97},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":98},{"type":"delay","time":"0.6","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2112_1#1$1","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","volume":"1","id":102},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":106},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":107},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"义经？！","id":108,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/75/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":109},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice3","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（不耐烦的低吼）","id":111},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"好吧，看来你的性格跟我差不多——别想独自抢走所有风头！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"要不来比一比谁解决的多吧？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice3","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（不屑的低吼）","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":119},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"嘿，这要是在火山，我可能就要慌了，但是，我已经吃过亏了！","id":120,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":121},{"type":"charslot","id":122},{"type":"dialog","id":123},{"type":"charslot","id":124},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"1","id":125},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":127},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":128},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":130},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":131},{"type":"charslot","id":132},{"type":"text","text":"空爆迅速地将盾斧形态切换回剑盾形态，与她僵持的钳兽失去了角力的对象，瞬间扑了个空。","id":133},{"type":"dialog","id":134},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_insect","id":135},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":136},{"type":"playsound","key":"$sheildimpact","id":137},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":138},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":140},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":142},{"type":"text","text":"在另一头钳兽的獠牙即将触及身体的瞬间，空爆手中的盾牌以一个精妙绝伦的角度迎了上去。那不是单纯的格挡，而是一种“迎接”。","id":143},{"type":"text","text":"巨大的冲击力让空爆脚下的土地都为之龟裂，但她纹丝不动。她清晰地感觉到敌人的力量正通过盾牌转化为自己的能量。","id":144},{"type":"dialog","id":145},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"1","id":146},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":148},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2a_1#8$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.4","id":151},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"轮到我了！","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/62/Avg_avg_1049_catap2a_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":154},{"type":"charslot","id":155},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_attack4","id":156},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_power1","id":157},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_ground","id":158},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_hit_slash_weapon02","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2112_1#1$1","id":160},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"false","id":162},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":163},{"type":"effect","name":"$eb_daoguang_blue","x":"-102.4","y":"141","rox":"171.3","roy":"-56.68","roz":"24.9","layer":"1","id":164},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_bladeline_red","x":"-20.1","y":"-70.4","rox":"-40.2","roy":"145","roz":"96","layer":"1","id":165},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_large","layer":"2","id":166},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_spark_01_mid","layer":"1","id":169},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_caxe_switch","id":170},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_drawsword_finish","id":171},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","ystrength":"40","xstrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":173},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"0.4","id":174},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":175},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#9$2","id":176},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"怎么样，义经，我这盾斧用得还不赖吧？","id":177,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/07/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-9$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":178},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice2","id":179},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（勉强承认的吼叫）","id":180},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":181},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈哈，你这家伙，还真是高傲。","id":182,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"好了，不说废话了，我们一起去找月见夜！","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":185},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","id":186},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（激昂的吼叫）","id":187},{"type":"dialog","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"dialog","id":191},{"type":"charslot","id":192},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":194},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":195},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":196},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crowdrun","volume":"1","id":197},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":198},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"就是这里！分离绞索，全员向预定地点撤退！快！","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":201},{"type":"charslot","id":202},{"type":"text","text":"武士们砍断绳索，放下了尸体，催动坐骑向着空地边缘的一处高地疾驰而去。","id":203},{"type":"text","text":"兽群失去了理智，它们眼中只有那具散发着诱人气息的巨大尸体。","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"它们蜂拥而上，密密麻麻地爬满了整个空地，为了争抢最好的位置而互相撕咬、踩踏。","id":205},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"天哪，这么多……这要是冲进城里……","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"斑弥罗，希望你这次能靠谱一点。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"你把那个信号弹射出去了？","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"嗯。","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"呃……是不是失败了？怎么一点反应都没有？","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"不可能，计算……","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":218},{"type":"charslot","id":219},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"3","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"60","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":220},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","volume":"1","id":221},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_sp_ballista","id":222},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"1","id":223},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":224},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":225},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"false","id":227},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":228},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"成功了……引爆很顺利。","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"地面……地面在裂开！以那具尸体为中心，整个地面都在往下掉！","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"掉下去了！那些野兽全都掉下去了！","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#4$2","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"哈哈哈，太壮观了！","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c7/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"别高兴得太早，空爆小姐。清点伤亡，然后——","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2107_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士B","text":"将军！我们脚下！我们脚下这块高地也在裂开！","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_2107_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"不是吧？！这里也要塌了？！","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":243},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"不好！塌陷范围超过了预期！快撤！","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/83/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":245},{"type":"charslot","id":246},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"25","ystrength":"25","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":249},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","loop":"false","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.3","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":251},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":252},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockfall","volume":"0.6","id":253},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"1","id":254},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":255},{"type":"text","text":"一块巨大的岩石从他们身边滚落，将队伍冲散。","id":256},{"type":"text","text":"混乱中，空爆和义经被岩石推向了一边，而月见夜为了保护几名险些坠落的武士，被另一波塌陷的土石隔绝开来，与大部队失去了联系。","id":257},{"type":"dialog","id":258},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":259},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":260},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":261},{"type":"dialog","id":262},{"type":"charslot","id":263},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_71_g1_impermanence_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":265},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":268,"musicid":2},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你不必跟着吾，也不用担心吾，吾答应了月见夜，自然会做到。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我相信你。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我只是……有点担心你。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……不必担心。这次“试炼”，是吾的“试炼”。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你们是被“御轮”送到这里的，泡影国本就对你们有所亏欠。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"现在，“异兽”已经被狩猎，“御轮”却出事，你们无法回家，吾更是无颜面对你们。","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这些都是吾必须扛起的责任。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你把自己绷得太紧了，宝巫迦。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"“御轮”的问题显然也不出在你身上，泡影国也好，你也好，你们都不亏欠我们什么。","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c5/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"谢谢你的好意，梓兰小姐。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但是，无论如何，对你来说，回到家园是头等大事吧？","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":291},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……没错。","id":292,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":293},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾一定会找到将你们送回去的方法。","id":294,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":295},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我不是想来催促你，只是——","id":296,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"是因为你的身边有一个和吾长得一样的孩子吗？","id":298,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你为什么会……","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"第一次见面的时候，你们对吾的态度，还有“泡普卡”这个名字，吾就有所猜测了。","id":302,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你一定很关心那个孩子，所以才会这么关心吾。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……也不是这个原因。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"也许一开始是，但现在也不是了。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"那么，为什么？","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"关心他人是理所当然的事情。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"但吾不需要。吾说过了，吾可以独自解决这些问题，吾做得到。","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你和月见夜一样，也在内心深处认为吾做不到，对吗？","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……如果是别人这么说，我确实会以为她在逞强，但是，我知道你做得到。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"那为什么——","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"在某种程度上，我理解月见夜的想法。","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"或许，他并不是害怕你做不到，他怕的是你做得到。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":325},{"type":"charslot","id":326},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":327},{"type":"playsound","key":"$smallearthquake","volume":"0.6","id":328},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"2","xstrength":"4","ystrength":"4","vibrato":"20","randomness":"30","fadeout":"true","id":329},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":330},{"type":"text","text":"都城里，所有人都被远处竹林传来的巨大声响和冲天烟尘所震撼。","id":331},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":332},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"成功了！月见夜将军成功了！东边的兽潮……消失了！","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"那家伙确实有两下子。","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"他总是这样……把所有危险都揽在自己身上。","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"听起来，你们本该是最亲密的伙伴，为什么会变成现在这样，总是针锋相对？","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":340},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"母亲政务繁忙……是他一直在吾身边。教吾战斗，陪吾读书。母亲失踪，吾刚刚继位的时候，也是他替吾承担了那些最麻烦的事务。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾感谢他，但是吾无法忍受每次提及“雷之主”时，他的那种目光。","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":344},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"他从未真正限制吾的行动，但他的目光却像是在告诉吾——“你去做吧，等你失败的时候，你会知道的。”","id":345,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……月见夜确实也有他的问题。这样吧，等他回来之后，我们一起吃顿饭。","id":347,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":348},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"好好聊一聊“雷之主”的事，如何？","id":349,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2e/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":350},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……好。","id":351,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/01/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"dialog","id":355},{"type":"charslot","id":356},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4b/Avg_bg_71_g4_bambooforest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":357},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":358},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":359},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":360},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":361,"musicid":3},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"月见夜呢？月见夜在哪？！","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2106_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军为了救我们，被……被塌方带到另一边去了！","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_npc_2106_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_hyper","volume":"0.4","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":369},{"type":"text","text":"突然，她听到远处传来一声熟悉的、充满王者威严的咆哮，不禁一怔。那声音穿透了尘埃与轰鸣，直击她的灵魂。","id":370},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"这个声音……难道说——“雷之主”？！它怎么会在这里？！糟了！","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#8$2","focus":"m","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"义经，我们走！","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b1/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-8$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$5","focus":"m","id":375},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（焦急的吼叫）","id":377},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":380},{"type":"dialog","id":381},{"type":"charslot","id":382},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"0.9","id":383},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":384},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":385},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":386},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":387},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（那是……月见夜手下的武士？全都倒下了……周围这些野兽的尸体……这里到底发生了什么？）","id":388,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":389},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（月见夜？！）","id":390,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":391},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（他怎么会……伤得这么重！铠甲都碎了……连刀都断了……喂喂，开玩笑的吧，你可别死啊！）","id":392,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":393},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"月见夜！你撑住！","id":394,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":395},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（糟了！动不了了！这股气息……是从哪里来的？！好可怕的压迫感……身体完全不听使唤了……）","id":396,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#12$2","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（头……只能勉强抬起来……）","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/de/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-12$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":399},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","id":400},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（愤怒的吼叫）","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":402},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（那是……“雷之主”？！）","id":403,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":404},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（它的样子……好奇怪……）","id":405,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":406},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（那些黑色的雾气……是“诅咒”吧？从那些野兽尸体上冒出来的……）","id":407,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":408},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（等等，“雷之主”身上发光了？那是什么？白色的光……）","id":409,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":410},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（这个光……我见过！和宝巫迦跳舞的时候一模一样！怎么可能？！）","id":411,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（它……它在吸收那些黑气！用宝巫迦的力量？！）","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#7$2","focus":"m","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"（为什么？！为什么这头野兽会用宝巫迦她们家族代代相传的神圣力量？！难道说……）","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/d3/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-7$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":416},{"type":"charslot","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"在吸收完所有“诅咒”之后，“雷之主”似乎心满意足。","id":418},{"type":"text","text":"它低下头，冰冷的兽瞳瞥了一眼地上的月见夜，随即仰天发出一声震耳欲聋的咆哮。","id":419},{"type":"dialog","id":420},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_skillroar_hyper","volume":"1","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"那咆哮中，似乎充满了无尽的威严与……胜利的宣告。","id":423},{"type":"dialog","id":424},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":425},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":426},{"type":"bgeffect","id":427},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"image","id":429},{"type":"charslot","id":430}],"characters":["空爆","月见夜","武士","义经","武士B","宝巫迦","梓兰"]}